msgid "Saved with {0} on its environment. Everyone who dictates in this project gets these spellings, along with their own dictionary. Project spellings win when the two overlap."
msgstr "与 {0} 一起保存在其环境中。所有在此项目中听写的人都会使用这些拼写，同时保留个人词典。两者重合时优先使用项目拼写。"

#: src/components/settings/VoiceSettingsPanel.tsx
msgid "Saved on the environment and used in every project there, along with each person’s own dictionary. Pick a project above to limit these words to one project."
msgstr "保存在环境中，供该环境的所有项目使用，同时保留个人词典。在上方选择项目可将这些词限定为仅在该项目使用。"

