#: src/components/settings/VoiceSettingsPanel.tsx
msgid "Transcription"
msgstr "转写"

#: src/components/settings/VoiceSettingsPanel.tsx
msgid "OpenAI handles silence automatically."
msgstr "OpenAI 会自动处理静音。"

#: src/components/settings/VoiceSettingsPanel.tsx
msgid "Skip silence and other non-speech audio before transcription, keeping a short buffer so words aren’t cut off."
msgstr "转写前跳过静音和其他非语音音频，并保留少量缓冲以免截断词语。"

#: src/components/settings/VoiceSettingsPanel.tsx
msgid "Remove filler words like “um” and “uh” from transcripts."
msgstr "从转写文本中移除「嗯」「呃」等语气词。"

#: src/components/settings/VoiceSettingsPanel.tsx
msgid "Names and terms transcription should spell your way, saved on this device. Add an alias when it keeps hearing a term wrong. The name of the project you dictate in is also sent as a hint."
msgstr "将希望采用的名称和术语拼写保存在此设备。某个术语经常被识别错误时，可添加别名。听写所在项目的名称也会作为提示发送。"

#: src/components/settings/VoiceSettingsPanel.tsx
msgid "Transcription options"
msgstr "转写选项"

#: src/components/settings/VoiceSettingsPanel.tsx
msgid "Fixes punctuation, numbers, and spoken corrections with the cleanup model on the draft’s environment. Sends the transcript and nearby draft text, never audio."
msgstr "在草稿所在环境中使用文本整理模型，修正标点、数字和口头纠正。只发送转写文本及附近草稿，不发送音频。"

